    <sys:String x:Key="ServerSettings_DestroyTamesOverTheSoftTameLimitLabel">Destroy tames over the soft tame limit</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="ServerSettings_DestroyTamesOverTheSoftTameLimitTooltip">Tames above the server's soft tame limit are marked for cryo and destroyed when their timer runs out unless they're cryopodded; marked and destroyed tames are logged in the tribe log. Unlike the normal tame limit, players can still tame and breed above it (DestroyTamesOverTheSoftTameLimit).</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="ServerSettings_MaxTamedDinos_SoftTameLimitLabel">Soft tame limit</sys:String>
